# Synthetic Demo Companies · Canonical Identities

*Atelier Nova SRL (Inbox demo) · Meridian Comerț Internațional SRL · codename Urban Novel Desk (Ask My Company demo)*

This file is the single source of truth for both synthetic companies and all their counterparties. Every document authored for the demo (PDFs, emails, contracts, invoices, accountant requests) references identities defined here. Do not invent identities outside this file. If a doc needs a counterparty not yet listed, add it here first.

---

## Safety conventions

All synthetic IDs are designed to be visually realistic but mechanically unable to collide with real Romanian entities or systems.

```
1   Inverted-E swap         every CUI · CNP · J-number · IBAN contains at least
                            one  Ɛ  (U+0190 LATIN CAPITAL LETTER OPEN E)
                            in place of a digit · reads as 3 to a human · is
                            classified as a letter · cannot validate against ANAF
                            or banking systems · also applied to phone numbers

2   .example TLD            all email domains end in  .example  (RFC 2606
                            reserved · guaranteed unregistrable)

3   Real street names       used for atmosphere · with synthetic street numbers
                            and postal codes

4   Synthetic personal names    common Romanian forms · do not deliberately match
                                well-known public individuals

5   No real entity overlap   names of synthetic companies and counterparties
                             should be checked against the ONRC public registry
                             before being added · verification is a builder
                             responsibility before each new identity is committed
```

